python3 -c "
import json,datetime;d=json.load(open('/tmp/st_all.json'))
def t(ms): return datetime.datetime.utcfromtimestamp(ms/1000).strftime('%H:%M:%S') if ms else None
for r in d['test_runs']+[s for s in d['submissions']]:
  print({k:(t(v) if k.endswith('_at') and isinstance(v,int) else v) for k,v in r.items() if not isinstance(v,(dict,list))})
" 2>&1 | head -60

